@if rooms() == 0
    songha[thinking]: I thought you were a trainee from another company. Or a ghost. I genuinely considered ghost.
@else
    songha[smile]: Every room tonight, it's been you. And I still wanted it to be you in mine. I wanted it anyway.
songha: I came back up the next three nights. Same time.
> He reports it like a logistics summary. Night one. Night two. Night three. Nobody.
songha: After that I figured you'd moved on. People do.
@textbox echo
echo: Displaying record contents.
@textbox normal
