@textbox echo
echo: Reconstruction complete. The owner may keep the room open for— {p} I do not have a fixed figure.
echo: Please take the time you need. {p} I am learning to say that.
@textbox normal
songha: Did the archive just learn "take your time"?
songha[smile]: That makes one of us. Almost.
> He unclips the pen from the notebook and holds it over the copied page. Over Year Five.
songha: What do I write? It's not done. It's not *not* done, either.
* [playful] "Write 'in progress.'"
    @rel songha closeness+1
    > He writes it. *In progress.* Then, smaller, underneath: *(good progress).*
